        "original_id": "36daab4b-374a-5506-b5ea-6aed483bcae7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Callis, Gaius Baltar, Richard Adar, David Eick, Count Baltar\n- TV series: Eureka, Battlestar Galactica\n- Organizations: Syfy\n\nFacts:\n- Eureka is an American science fiction television series that premiered on Syfy on July 18, 2006.\n- In 2010, James Callis joined the cast of the Syfy television series Eureka.\n- Dr. Gaius Baltar is a fictional character in the television series Battlestar Galactica, and James Callis played him as a reimagining of Count Baltar from the 1978 Battlestar Galactica series.\n- In the Battlestar Galactica miniseries, Richard Adar was portrayed in a still picture in Doctor Gaius Baltar's house by producer David Eick wearing age-enhancing makeup.",
